      CODED.
      (1) config/secure-record-owner-role.json: + sprk_invoice (prvReadsprk_Invoice, child). Writer: task 130
          InvoiceReviewService.CreateInvoiceRecordAsync (InvoiceReviewService.cs:604 on work/unified-access-control-r2),
